In Rotation Battles, you send out three
Pokémon at a time and battle!{VAR BE01}
One Pokémon takes the lead position,
and the other two stand on each side.{VAR BE01}
The trick is, each turn you can change
their positions...{VAR BE01}
And that's a rough explanation
of Rotation Battles.{VAR BE01}

